## Visiting Practical Info

Freycinet Vineyard is located at 15919 Tasman Highway, Apslawn, Tasmania 7190. The phone number is (03) 6257 8574. Their website is http://www.freycinetvineyard.com.au/. The winery is situated near the town of Bicheno.

## Notable / Distinctive

Freycinet Vineyard holds the distinction of being the first commercial winery established on Tasmania's East Coast. It is a pioneering, family-owned and operated business, now spanning three generations. The vineyard's site is uniquely warm and sheltered within the generally cool Tasmanian climate. All wines are 100% grown, produced, and bottled on the estate. The founder, Geoff Bull, had a notable prior career as a photographer for the Sydney Morning Herald and later as a commercial abalone diver in Tasmania.

